  "releaseNotes": "AIKernel.Core package family v0.0.5 - Aligns with AIKernel.NET contract packages v0.0.5, including interface-only contract packages, external Capability module contracts, Core MemoryRegion/MemoryMapper abstractions with Kernel Win32/POSIX implementations, DynamicSLM/SeedSLM contract vocabulary, HATL cryptographic operator boundaries, governance admissibility evidence, and Semantic Compilation DTOs. GPU and Native ABI implementations are external Capability packages.",
